\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par All glory be to God on High\cf0 
\par and peace on earth from Heaven dwell
\par And God's will unfailingly
\par be to all people here giving
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We bless, we worship you,
\par We raise for your Great Glory
\par Thanks and praise; O God, Almighty Father.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  O Lamb of God Lord Jesus Christ
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Whom God the Father gave us
\par who for the world was sacrificed
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Opon the cross to save us
\par And as you sit at God's right hand
\par and we for judgement there must stand
\par Have mercy Lord upon us.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  You only are the Holy one
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 who came for our salvation
\par and only you are God's true Son
\par who was before creation
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par you only Christ as Lord we own
\par And with your spirit, you alone
\par share in the Father's glory.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  We praise Thee Lord, we give Thee Thanks
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 in honour and adoration
\par Our farther, King who changeth not
\par and perfectly rule over us
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thy strength and glory so most great
\par Thy will shall evermore be done.
\par \pard      Thank you, thank you, Master and Lord.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

